## 10. Deployment Automation

### Deployment Script

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# deploy-aws-platform.sh

set -e

echo "🚀 Deploying MaritimeIQ Platform to AWS"

# 1. Initialize Terraform
cd infrastructure/terraform
terraform init

# 2. Plan deployment
terraform plan -out=tfplan \
  -var="app_name=maritime-platform" \
  -var="environment=dev"

# 3. Apply deployment
terraform apply tfplan

# 4. Configure kubectl
aws eks update-kubeconfig \
  --name maritime-eks \
  --region us-east-1

# 5. Deploy application
kubectl apply -f ../k8s/maritime-api.yaml

# 6. Deploy Lambda
cd ../../functions
zip function.zip lambda_function.py
aws lambda update-function-code \
  --function-name process-ais-data \
  --zip-file fileb://function.zip

echo "✅ Deployment completed!"
```

